  "details": "The beta documentation U# example for [**Sending Events with Parameters**](<https://vrc-beta-docs.netlify.app/worlds/udon/networking/events/#sending-events-with-parameters>) has a compile error.\n\nThe example is completely missing the first parameter of `NetworkCalling.SendCustomNetworkEvent` which should be `(IUdonEventReceiver)this`.\n\nHere's the corrected snippet:\n\n```cs\n\nusing UdonSharp;\n\nusing UnityEngine;\n\nusing VRC.SDK3.UdonNetworkCalling;\n\nusing VRC.Udon.Common.Interfaces;\n\npublic class EnumDefaultTest : UdonSharpBehaviour\n\n{\n\n    public override void Interact()\n\n    {\n\n        NetworkCalling.SendCustomNetworkEvent((IUdonEventReceiver)this, NetworkEventTarget.All, nameof(PrintMessage), \"VRCat\", 11);\n\n    }\n\n    [NetworkCallable]\n\n    public void PrintMessage(string name, int age)\n\n    {\n\n        Debug.Log($\"Congratulations on your {age}th birthday, {name}!\");\n\n    }\n\n}\n\n```",
